OL,3,GNEWSA'We're exhausted after sleeping on
OL,4,Aairport floor'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It has been horrendous," says Kelly
OL,7,FFewery, after spending the night
OL,8,Fsleeping on an airport floor.
OL,10,FShe is stranded with her husband, Alan
OL,11,FJones, and their son and niece, at
OL,12,FDalaman Airport in Turkey since an air
OL,13,Ftraffic control fault in the UK
OL,14,Fcancelled more than 1,750 flights.
OL,16,FThe family, from Blackpool, said it was
OL,17,F"absolute chaos" at the airport after
OL,18,Ftheir 23:30 Jet2 return flight to
OL,19,FManchester was cancelled on Tuesday
OL,20,Fnight.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
