OL,3,GNEWSA'We're exhausted after sleeping on
OL,4,Aairport floor'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJones, 51, said they were frustrated
OL,7,Fwith a lack of communication from Jet 2
OL,8,FStaff, adding: "We are all absolutely
OL,9,Fexhausted. We got very little sleep."
